# Skills and MCP

Full list: `AGENTS.md` section **Required skills and MCP**.

**Must use:** project `beads`; superpowers `using-git-worktrees`,
`finishing-a-development-branch`, `verification-before-completion`,
`requesting-code-review` / `receiving-code-review`, `systematic-debugging`,
`test-driven-development`. Orchestrator also: `subagent-driven-development`,
`dispatching-parallel-agents`, `writing-plans`.

**When the task matches:** `tailwindcss` (panel CSS; `input.css` is frozen
until the UI bead), `cli-for-agents` (`install.sh` / `bootstrap.sh` /
`panel` CLI), Cursor `review-security` / `review-bugbot` before merge.

**MCP required for live panel checks:** Playwright plugin and/or
`cursor-ide-browser`. SSH to the VPS is the shell, not an MCP.

**Do not treat as required:** Figma MCPs (UI redesign deferred), GitHub MCP
(no git remote), Orca (`orca-cli` / orchestration) until Orca.app is
installed — use Cursor Task. Do not install random skills.sh Go/Docker
packs; this repo has its own compose, installers, and tests.
